      "category": "Text",
      "text": "By virtue of the powers vested in me by the New York City Charter, and pursuant to the resolution adopted by the Board of Estimate on December 20, 1962 (Cal. No. 458), and in accordance with the terms of an agreement entered into on September 30, 1963 between the City of New York and District Council, No. 37, A.F.S.C.M.E., AFL-CIO, implementation of the terms of Paragraph 4 of the aforementioned Board of Estimate resolution is hereby ordered.",
