      "text": "(1) Payments to the District Council 37 Welfare Fund are hereby authorized on the pro-rata basis not to exceed $50 per year for each employee in the title of Motor Vehicle Operator, whether a union member or not, employed as a Motor Vehicle Operator, as follows:",
